<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Knights Q1 pre-capex net falls.</title>
<headline>Knights Q1 pre-capex net falls.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-March versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net profit before capital spending</p>
<p>					  0.99  vs 4.02</p>
<p>    Capital spending		0.41  vs 0.21</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled		916,000  vs 940,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)		 297  vs 323</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)		  0.33  vs 0.34</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)	    50.432 vs 55.898</p>
<p>Full name: Knights Gold Mining Co Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - All hedging contracts for the quarter have been closed, the cost of which has been included as an abnormal item worth 1.14 million rand versus 1.2 million last quarter. Previous quarter and year-to-date figures have been altered for comparison.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
